      en: ["Located in Corentyne, Region 6 (East Berbice).", "Focuses on rice milling and agro-industrial processing.", "Part of the government's industrial decentralization policy.", "Supports small-scale farmers with local processing options.", "Provides incentives for manufacturing firms to relocate.", "A key economic driver for communities in the Berbice region."],
